completed_at: "2026-08-17T13:33:11.792Z"
author: "harness:codex"
parent: pm-usfg
resolution: Complete-list recovery integration now proves PmCompleteListValidationError before reading its receipt.
expected_result: Static analysis and runtime execution both prove the recovery error exists before dereference.
actual_result: Explicit instanceof guard replaces non-null assertions; focused integration and ESLint pass.
