comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-17T07:44:20.811Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-17: searched all statuses for GH-1052, typed fail-closed whole-list, complete-list validation, and whole-corpus SDK reads. No item owns this exact reusable guarantee; pm-rjqr is the closed query-SDK source, pm-usfg is the SDK-first parent, pm-5t33or owns output receipts, and pm-pae3wo owns cross-version read compatibility. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1052"
  "2026-08-17T08:20:02.420Z","harness:codex","Tracker quality: the whole-list primitive implements the output-receipt contract and verifies cross-version read compatibility; generic related edges were too weak to encode either fact."
  "2026-08-17T11:49:48.349Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-17: deliver one coupled SDK/CLI/package-assurance tranche covering fail-closed whole-corpus reads, mode-sensitive package catalog output controls, and source-derived executable recovery obligations. Scope includes public types, command/runtime contracts, CLI and SDK behavior, generated surfaces, temporary-workspace acceptance, negative controls, docs, and packed consumers."
  "2026-08-17T13:08:40.518Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence 2026-08-17: added typed listAllComplete primitives across query/core/runtime/root entrypoints. Certification fails closed over source completeness, all-status scope, strict reads, terminal inclusion, full projection, paging/count consistency, field/budget/session omissions, and unique valid identities, with an exact executable CLI/SDK recovery receipt. The default full projection regression found by the packed test is covered. Linked tests pass 28/28; full repository coverage passes 515 files and 7,502 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; public surface, contracts, docs, typecheck, ESLint, jscpd, package artifact, npm/npx, Bun/bunx, dogfood, and external-package gates pass."
  "2026-08-17T13:12:15.835Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1054 at implementation head 7d03a39ccde25a846cb099cb08b1a7840668abff. Hosted checks and full bot review are in progress."
  "2026-08-17T13:17:58.881Z","harness:codex","Review finding 2026-08-17: DeepScan NULL_POINTER identified that the recovery integration used a non-null assertion after a Vitest definedness assertion. The runtime catches a typed validation error, but external analysis cannot use the test matcher for control-flow narrowing. Replace it with an explicit instanceof guard and rerun exact gates."
  "2026-08-17T13:19:19.475Z","harness:codex","Review fix evidence 2026-08-17: replaced the analyzer-opaque non-null assertion with an explicit PmCompleteListValidationError runtime guard before both recovery receipt reads. The focused real-entrypoint integration passes 3/3 and repo-wide ESLint passes with zero warnings."
  "2026-08-17T13:24:35.637Z","harness:codex","Hosted gate finding 2026-08-17: after the DeepScan review closeout updated the item's terminal chronology, changelog:pm:check correctly failed because CHANGELOG.md predated that final tracker state. Regenerate with pm-changelog 2026.8.17 after this evidence entry, then leave PM state immutable through the next exact-head run."
  "2026-08-17T13:44:29.333Z","harness:codex","Merged delivery evidence 2026-08-17: PR #1054 exact head e382745a4 merged as main commit 52d2e95cdf152374308308536b57122cebaebe97 after 28 hosted checks passed. GH #1052 closed automatically. DeepScan's sole NULL_POINTER finding was fixed with explicit PmCompleteListValidationError narrowing and the final DeepScan run reported zero findings; complete-list SDK acceptance, recovery execution, structured defect evidence, and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage are on main."
